lled %s'=>'Naplaćuje se %s','Billing'=>'Naplata','Billing & Invoices'=>'Naplata i računi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Blokirano','Blocking'=>'Blokiranje','Blog ID'=>'ID bloga','Body'=>'Tijelo','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Da – obje adrese su moje','Bundle'=>'Paket','Bundle Plan'=>'Paketni plan','Business name'=>'Naziv tvrtke','Buy license'=>'Kupite licencu','Buy a license now'=>'Kupite licencu sada','Cancel'=>'Odustani','Cancel Installation'=>'Otkaži instalaciju','Cancel Subscription'=>'Otkaži pretplatu','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'U slučaju da NE planirate koristiti ovaj %1$s na ovoj web-stranici (ili bilo kojoj drugoj web-stranici) – želite li otkazati i %2$s?','Cancel Trial'=>'Otkaži probno razdoblje','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Otkazivanje probnog razdoblja odmah će blokirati pristup svim premium značajkama. Jeste li sigurni?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Otkaži %s i nastavi','Cancelled'=>'Otkazano','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Otkazivanje pretplate','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ne možete pronaći svoj licencni ključ?','Change License'=>'Promijeni licencu','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Potvrdna e-pošta upravo je poslana na %s. Morate potvrditi ažuriranje u sljedeća 4 sata. Ako ne možete pronaći e-poštu, provjerite svoju mapu neželjene pošte.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Potvrdna e-poruka upravo je poslana na %s. Vlasnik e-pošte mora potvrditi ažuriranje unutar sljedeća 4 sata.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s je novi vlasnik računa.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Hvala vam što ste potvrdili promjenu